    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMeow Cafe\u201d invites players into the heartwarming world of a quaint cat cafe. As the owner, you\u2019ll blend the art of business management with the joy of feline companionship. Your mission is to transform a charming cafe into a sanctuary for cats and a haven for customers alike.  In this delightful virtual world, you\u2019ll serve coffee and desserts to customers, rescue stray cats, and facilitate adoptions. Inspired by real-life characters from New York City, Meow Cafe weaves heartwarming stories centered around the bonds between cats and humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Lucy, a passionate cat lover in the heart of New York City, as you take on the role of a cat caf\u00e9 owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and rescue a variety of adorable cats, each with unique personalities and stories. Provide them with a safe home in your caf\u00e9, and match them with the perfect adopters to ensure they find their forever families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=538 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet fascinating characters. Engage in heartfelt conversations, uncover their personal stories, and build meaningful connections as they become part of your caf\u00e9\u2019s journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your caf\u00e9 experience by upgrading your menu with delicious new food and specialty cat items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this heartwarming adventure filled with love, laughter, and life-changing moments. Your journey as a cat caf\u00e9 owner awaits\u2014are you ready to make a difference, one cat at a time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMeow Cafe\u201d invites players into the heartwarming world of a quaint cat cafe. As the owner, you\u2019ll blend the art of business management with the joy of feline companionship. Your mission is to transform a charming cafe into a sanctuary for cats and a haven for customers alike.  In this delightful virtual world, you\u2019ll serve coffee and desserts to customers, rescue stray cats, and facilitate adoptions. Inspired by real-life characters from New York City, Meow Cafe weaves heartwarming stories centered around the bonds between cats and humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/a92667da57480a9be1d60d4ee6ed4db5.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Lucy, a passionate cat lover in the heart of New York City, as you take on the role of a cat caf\u00e9 owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/39add442406dd09814954b84042b8807.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and rescue a variety of adorable cats, each with unique personalities and stories. Provide them with a safe home in your caf\u00e9, and match them with the perfect adopters to ensure they find their forever families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=538 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/df0830b1f225efe2a3cc22d4b03badeb.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet fascinating characters. Engage in heartfelt conversations, uncover their personal stories, and build meaningful connections as they become part of your caf\u00e9\u2019s journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/4213613e9d1365209bfc9c4500cd4069.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your caf\u00e9 experience by upgrading your menu with delicious new food and specialty cat items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.poster.avif?t=1754320289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.webm?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159560/extras/e26a0e5c3a7dc8f3488d509f65368803.mp4?t=1754320289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this heartwarming adventure filled with love, laughter, and life-changing moments. Your journey as a cat caf\u00e9 owner awaits\u2014are you ready to make a difference, one cat at a time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
